{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link href=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/web_font/nexon_gothic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">/* 기본 */\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGL {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light' !important;}\r\n            .font_NGB {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Bold' !important;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:break-word;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap i {font-style:normal;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;font-weight:400;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;text-rendering:optimizeSpeed;letter-spacing:-0.05em;-webkit-letter-spacing:-0.25px;text-align:center;color:#424242;line-height:1.4;padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT SIZE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.3333em;}/*16px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.5em;}/*18px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2em;}/*24px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:2.6667em;}/*32px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:4em;}/*48px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:5.1667em;}/*62px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:7.8em;}/*94px*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p_sub {font-size:0.6em;vertical-align:baseline;}/*아래첨자*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p_sup {font-size:0.6em;vertical-align:text-top;}/*위첨자*/\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .p_side {font-size:0.6em;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT STYLE CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_04 {line-height:0.4;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_l {text-align:left;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ta_r {text-align:right;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .t_up {text-transform:uppercase;}\r\n\r\n            /* FONT COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_black {color:#121212;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_gray {color:#666666;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_richblack {color:#071a1d;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_skyblue {color:#6ab0d0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_tealblue {color:#006c99;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_red {color:#ea3d3d;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_rosewood {color:#724848;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .color_coralred {color:#fd6d6d;}\r\n\r\n            /* BG COLOR CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_white {background-color:#fff;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_skywhite {background-color:#f5f5f5;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_rosewhite {background-color:#f9f2f2;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_red {background-color:#ea3d3d;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_darkgray {background-color:#424242;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_lightcoral {background-color:#ea5b5b;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_pinegreen {background-color:#107f64;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_ashbrown {background-color:#524747;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_dustyrose {background-color:#d9c0c0;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_palerose {background-color:#efdddd;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_linenpink {background-color:#f6eeee;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bg_coralred {background-color:#fd6d6d;}\r\n\r\n            /* MARGIN CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_02em {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_15em {margin-top:1.5em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:10px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:100px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n\r\n            /* PADDING CSS */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pd_40 {padding:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_20 {padding-top:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_40 {padding-top:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_50 {padding-top:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_60 {padding-top:60px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:80px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_20 {padding-bottom:20px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_40 {padding-bottom:40px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_50 {padding-bottom:50px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_60 {padding-bottom:60px;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n            \r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_2step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 49%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 32%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_4step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 24%);justify-content:space-between;row-gap:3em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_textList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.8em auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;gap:0.25em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .grid_bulletList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.5em auto;justify-content:center;align-items:start;gap:1.25em 1em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c {display:flex;align-items:center;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_auto {flex:auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .flex_c_auto {flex:auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}\r\n\r\n            /* TABLE STYLE */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap table{width:100%;padding:0;border:0;border-spacing:0px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:unset;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style1 th {background-color:#f3f3f3;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;padding:1.9em 0 1.7em;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;color:#121212;font-weight:600;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style1 td {border:1px solid #ccc;padding:1.7em 0 1.5em;vertical-align:middle;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style1 tr td:nth-child(3) {border-left:2px solid #fd6d6d;border-right:2px solid #fd6d6d;color:#724848;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style1 tr:last-child td:nth-child(3) {border-bottom:2px solid #fd6d6d;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style1 tr th:nth-child(3) {border-left:2px solid #fd6d6d;border-right:2px solid #fd6d6d;border-top:2px solid #fd6d6d;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style2 th {background-color:#f9f2f2;border:1px solid #e0d0c3;vertical-align:middle;padding:1.9em 0 1.7em;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e1e1;color:#724848;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Table_Style2 td {border:1px solid #e0d0c3;padding:1.7em 0 1.5em;vertical-align:middle;}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w84 {width:84%;margin-left:8%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w86 {width:86%;margin-left:7%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .mgAuto {margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .pos_r {position:relative;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wMax {width:max-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .wFit {width:fit-content;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .opac80 {opacity:0.8;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:0.8333em;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_l_10 {border-radius:0.8333em 0 0 0.8333em;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_r_10 {border-radius:0 0.8333em 0.8333em 0;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .bdr_Line {border:1px solid #d9d9d9;border-radius:0.8333em;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Round_LineBar {border:0.1667em solid #171e7c;border-radius:200px;padding:1em 1.5em 0.7em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Round_TitleBar {display:inline-block;position:absolute;border-radius:200px;padding:0.5em 1em 0.4em;top:0;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .SpanBox {padding:0.1em 0.15em 0.05em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Box_Shadow {-webkit-box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04); box-shadow:0 0 1.25em 0.5em rgba(0,0,0,0.04);}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .Text_Underline {text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:0.25em;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:block;}\r\n\r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .Point_Num {display:flex;align-items:center;width:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}\r\n            .Point_Num p {padding:0.4em 0.7em 0.3em;}\r\n            .Point_Absolute {position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .KeyImg .key_TextBox {position:absolute;top:12%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 제품특징 */\r\n            .Product_Feature li {border:1px solid #bebebe;display:flex;margin-top:1.2em;}\r\n            .Product_Feature li p {padding:0.5em 1em 0.4em;}\r\n            .Product_Feature li p:nth-child(1) {flex:0 1em;display:flex;align-items:center;background: #ea3d3d;border-right:1px solid #bebebe;}\r\n            .Product_Feature li p:nth-child(2) {flex:1 calc(100% - 1em);color:#121212;}\r\n            .OneDays p {position:absolute;width:100%;top:8%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 고식이섬유 함유 */\r\n            .Fiber {position:absolute;width:100%;bottom:20%;}\r\n\r\n            /* 동결건조 딸기 다이스 */\r\n            .Freeze_Drying {display:grid;grid-template-columns:42% auto 42%;justify-content:space-between;}\r\n\r\n            /* 섭취방법 */\r\n            .HowtoConsume {display:grid;grid-template-columns:29% 6.5% 29% 6.5% 29%;justify-content:space-between;}\r\n\r\n             /* 단백질, 왜 먹어야 할까요? */\r\n            .Protein {width:42%}\r\n            .Protein p {position:absolute;width:max-content;}\r\n            .Protein p:nth-child(1) {top:0;left:82.598%;transform:translateY(-30%) rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Protein p:nth-child(2) {top:7.5%;left:77.2059%;} \r\n            .Protein p:nth-child(3) {top:17%;right:0;transform:translateX(100%) rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Protein p:nth-child(4) {top:34.8%;left:0;transform:translateX(-100%) rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Protein p:nth-child(5) {top:67%;left:93.1373%;}\r\n            .Protein_Graph {display:grid;grid-template-columns:30% 24% 19% 14% 10%;justify-content:space-between;row-gap:0.8em;}\r\n            .Protein_Graph .Protein_BG {background:url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus_bg_01.jpg) repeat left top;background-size:cover;}\r\n\r\n            /* 나이가 들수록 중요한 ‘단백질’ */\r\n            .Protein_Age {border:0.4167em solid #f5f5f5;border-radius:1.667em;}\r\n            .Protein_Age ul {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 19.2%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n\r\n            /* 우리 몸 속 많은 역할을 하는 ‘단백질’ */\r\n            .Protein_Role {width:77%;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p {position:absolute;width:18.4%;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(1) {top:21.65%;left:0;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(2) {top:60.61%;left:0;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(3) {bottom:0;left:0;transform:translateY(100%) rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(4) {top:21.65%;right:0;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(5) {top:60.61%;right:0;}\r\n            .Protein_Role p:nth-child(6) {bottom:0;right:0;transform:translateY(100%) rotate(0.04deg);}\r\n\r\n            /* 매일, 꾸준한 단백질 섭취 */\r\n            .Protein_Intake {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 29.9%);justify-content:start;column-gap:2.5%;}\r\n            .Protein_Intake li:nth-child(3) {transform:translateX(10%);}\r\n            .Protein_Intake li:nth-child(3):after {content:\"\";width:117%;height:110%;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;transform:translate(-8.5%, -6%);border:0.4167em solid #ea3d3d;border-radius:0.8333em;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .Protein_Intake li {display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .Brand_Grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 58%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#ccc solid 1px;text-align:left;}\r\n            .Brand_Grid .logo_img {max-width:25% !important;margin-top:1em;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_10 {margin-top:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_20 {margin-top:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_40 {margin-top:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.83337vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_100 {margin-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pd_40 {padding:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_20 {padding-top:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_40 {padding-top:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_50 {padding-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_60 {padding-top:5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pt_80 {padding-top:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_20 {padding-bottom:1.6667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_40 {padding-bottom:3.3333vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_50 {padding-bottom:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_60 {padding-bottom:5vw;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1080px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p0 {font-size:1.6em;}/*16px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p1 {font-size:1.8em;}/*18px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p2 {font-size:2.4em;}/*24px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p3 {font-size:3.2em;}/*32px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p4 {font-size:4.8em;}/*48px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p5 {font-size:6em;}/*62px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .p6 {font-size:7.6em;}/*94px*/\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .grid_bulletList img {margin-top:0.2em;}\r\n                .Protein {width:56%}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:920px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap .w75, .Product_DetailWrap .w83 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:820px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:7px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:620px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:6px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .Brand_Grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .Brand_Grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:520px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:5px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:420px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:4px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:320px) {\r\n                .Product_DetailWrap {font-size:3px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"Product_DetailWrap\">\n<section class=\"KeyImg pos_r\">\n<div class=\"key_TextBox w90 lh_12\">\n<p class=\"p3\">하루의 시작, 날 위한 한 끼</p>\n<p class=\"p6 font_NGB color_richblack mt_10\">액티브 디에스 프로 플러스</p>\n<p class=\"p3 font_NMr color_skyblue\">ActiveDS Pro Plus</p>\n<p class=\"p4 color_tealblue mt_40\"><span class=\"fw_600\">특별한 헬시 라이프의 시작</span><br/>\r\n더 맛있고, 더 건강하게!</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus_keyimg.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<section class=\"w75 mt_100\">\n<p class=\"p5 color_black lh_12\">액티브 디에스 프로 플러스<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">제품 특징</span></p>\n<ul class=\"Product_Feature mt_40\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_white\">1</p>\n<p class=\"p3 ta_l\">5종의 식물성 + 동물성 단백질 함유</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_white\">2</p>\n<p class=\"p3 ta_l\">고식이섬유 &amp; 가벼운 칼로리</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_white\">3</p>\n<p class=\"p3 ta_l\">초유, 유산균, 효소 등을 포함한 엄선한 영양 부원료</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_white\">4</p>\n<p class=\"p3 ta_l\">더욱 부드럽고 맛있어진 딸기맛!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 color_white\">5</p>\n<p class=\"p3 ta_l\">동결건조 딸기 다이스로 씹는 즐거움 UP!</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"grid_3step mt_70\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"OneDays bdr_10 pos_r\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 color_black\">MORNING</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus_img_01_01.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">하루의 시작,<br/>\r\n\t어디서나 든든한 한끼</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"OneDays bdr_10 pos_r\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 color_black\">AFTERNOON</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus_img_01_02.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">바쁜 하루 일과 중,<br/>\r\n\t점심을 챙길 수 없을 때</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"OneDays bdr_10 pos_r\">\n<p class=\"p2 fw_600 color_black\">NIGHT</p>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus/ActiveDS_Pro_Plus_img_01_03.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_20\">운동 전/후<br/>\r\n\t가볍게 단백질 보충<br/>\n<span class=\"p_side\">(1회 섭취량당 단백질 12g 함유)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"p2 color_black lh_04 mt_50\">.<br/>\r\n.<br/>\r\n.<br/>\r\n.<br/>\r\n.</p>\n<div class=\"bg_ro